##grflangid 0x01
STR_GRF_NAME     :Small-Town Downtown
STR_GRF_DESC     :Adds six small-town Main Street buildings from 1900-1960: a brick commercial block, an Art Deco theatre, and a matching stone set of town bank, post office, town hall and Carnegie library. Towns never build them themselves: place them by hand with the house picker.
STR_BRICK_BLOCK  :Brick Commercial Block
STR_TOWN_BANK    :Town Bank
STR_ROXY_THEATRE :Roxy Theatre
STR_POST_OFFICE      :Post Office
STR_TOWN_HALL        :Town Hall
STR_CARNEGIE_LIBRARY :Carnegie Library
